        ]
      },
      "worked": "Number cards have ranks $2$ through $10$. The permitted ordered pairs (Bob, Mary) are $(2,9),(3,8),(4,7),(5,6),(6,5),(7,4),(8,3),(9,2)$. Each rank has four cards, and the draws from separate decks are independent.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{both number cards summing to }11)&=8\\times\\frac{4}{52}\\times\\frac{4}{52}\\\\P(\\text{both number cards summing to }11)&=\\frac{8}{169}.\\end{align*}$$",
